  url: '''
    {{baseurl}}/translate?text=A question that has become a meme and a cultural phenomenon. "What would Elon do?" refers to the idea of imagining how Elon Musk, the billionaire entrepreneur and business magnate, would approach a particular situation or problem.
    
    Elon Musk is known for his innovative and often unconventional thinking, as well as his willingness to take risks and challenge the status quo. He has founded or co-founded companies like PayPal, SpaceX, Tesla, Neuralink, and The Boring Company, and has become a household name in the tech and business worlds.&locale=no
